OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves Hanley city
OL,4,Acentre masterplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses have signed off on a
OL,7,F"masterplan" for Hanley to make it the
OL,8,F"city centre" of Stoke-on-Trent again.
OL,10,FThe planning vision includes a
OL,11,Fprogramme of redevelopment on
OL,12,Fbrownfield sites, aiming to provide
OL,13,Fenough housing for an additional 1,800
OL,14,Fpeople to live in the city centre by
OL,15,F2030.
OL,17,FIt would also involve setting up a
OL,18,Fregeneration body to oversee the
OL,19,Fproject. Paul Williams, the director of
OL,20,FStoke-on-Trent's Business Improvement
OL,21,FDistrict, said this would be crucial to
OL,22,Fdelivering the plans.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
